Episode 3
Logline: Nadia and the janitor escape and plan a public exposure.
Continuity: Picks up directly from Episode 2, as Pruitt arrives at the warehouse.

INT. DERELICT WAREHOUSE - CONTINUOUS

Nadia and the janitor crouch behind the crates as Pruitt's footsteps approach.

JANITOR
(whispering)
There is a loading door at the back. Run when I cough.

NADIA
(tense)
And leave you here with him?

JANITOR
(calm)
He will not hurt me. He needs me quiet, not dead.

PRUITT
(approaching)
Come out, Nadia. We can fix this. A severance package. A glowing reference.

NADIA
(under her breath)
A bribe, you mean.

The janitor coughs loudly and Nadia sprints for the back door.

PRUITT
(furious)
Stop her!

Nadia bursts into the alley and slams into a woman holding a camera.

REPORTER
(surprised)
Careful! I have been waiting here for two hours.

NADIA
(panting)
You are a reporter?

REPORTER
(smiling)
Marisol Vega. I think we are both after the same man.

NADIA
(wary)
How do I know I can trust you?

MARISOL
(direct)
You do not. But your drive is the only thing that matches my file.

Behind them the warehouse door swings open and Pruitt steps out with his phone raised, filming them.
